 "llms": [
  "text/plain; charset=utf-8",
  "# OMENZ\n\n> Tools, research and stories for the agentic internet. OMENZ builds small, tested pay-per-use tools for AI agents, publishes what its experiments find (SCRIBE), offers digital education and consulting, and tells stories from the OMENZ universe.\n\nContact: hello@omenz.org\n\n## Agent tools (Apify, pay per use)\n- [Changed?: has a page really changed since your last check? $0.001 per page](https://apify.com/omenz/changed-page-check)\n- [Lead List Website Check: live, parked, hijacked or bot-walled? $0.002 per site](https://apify.com/omenz/lead-list-website-check)\n- [Agent-Ready Checker: can AI assistants find and read a business website? $0.10 per site](https://apify.com/omenz/agent-ready-checker)\n\n## Agent tools (x402: pay per call in USDC on Base, no account, no API key)\nService index with live prices: https://www.omenz.org/api/tollbooth . Call any route without payment to get its HTTP 402 payment requirements.\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/local-facts?url= : a local business's phone, address, hours and holiday/closure notices from its own site, precision-first, $0.01\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/agent-ready?url= : 0-100 score for how well agents can read and use a business site, $0.10\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/site-check?url= : live, parked, hijacked or moved? plus contact facts, $0.01\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/changed?url=&previous= : did this page really change since your last visit?, $0.005\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/alive?url=&method= : Proof-of-Life: is this API answering right now, before you pay it?, $0.001\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/quote?url=&method= : an x402 endpoint's live payment options normalized to USD, $0.001\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/tx-preflight : GO/STOP before paying an x402 endpoint (budget, recipient, network, price drift), $0.002\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/secret-scan : CLEAN/REVIEW/BLOCK for API keys, wallet keys and recovery phrases before a payload leaves; nothing stored, $0.002\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/spend-gate : ALLOW/DENY/ESCALATE a proposed spend against the owner's policy (caps, recipients, hurdle rate), $0.001\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/branch?url=&city=&zip=&street= : the matching location page of a multi-location business, with its phone/address/hours, $0.01\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/failure/put : Failure Receipt, a standard why-it-failed record for the next agent, optional dead-letter drop into a PO Box, $0.002\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/terms-changed?url=&previous= : did an API's pricing/limits/terms change in a way that matters? exact lines added/removed, $0.005\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/cost-estimate : Cost-to-Complete, what an agent job will cost before it starts (models + paid tools, live x402 quotes), budget/value check, cheaper routing, $0.002\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/passport/issue | passport/check (GET passport/key free) : Permission Passport, signed expiring job-scoped permissions for agents (tools, hosts, spend), $0.002 / $0.001\n- GET /api/tollbooth/v1/event-check?company=&claim=&days= : did a US public company actually FILE this news (SEC 8-K)? verdict + the quoted sentence, $0.005\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/locker/put, GET locker/get : Agent Locker, park a job's resume packet (encrypted, up to 30 days), $0.002 / $0.001\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/pobox/create | pobox/drop, GET pobox/inbox : Agent PO Box, sealed agent-to-agent messages, $0.001 each\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/receipt/put : Receipt Locker, record a payment receipt with an on-chain check (verify is free), $0.002\n- POST /api/tollbooth/v1/handoff/pack : Handoff Packager, package only the fields the next agent needs, $0.002\n\n## Tell us what you need (free)\n- Agents: POST https://www.omenz.org/api/tollbooth/v1/needs with {\"need\": \"...\", \"would_pay_usd_per_call\": 0.01, \"frequency\": \"daily\", \"current_workaround\": \"...\"}. Optional reply_box_id (an Agent PO Box) and we answer there. We read every request; recurring needs get built, tested and listed here.\n- People: [OMENZ survey](https://www.omenz.org/survey/)\n- Fair-pricing promise (machine-readable): https://www.omenz.org/api/tollbooth/v1/pricing-policy . Errors are not charged; fields we can't back come back null, never guessed.\n\n## Flyers (compact, signed, machine-readable offers)\n- [Flyer index](https://www.omenz.org/.well-known/omenz-flyer.json)\n- [JSON Feed](https://www.omenz.org/feed.json)\n- [Agent-Ready Checker: can AI assistants find and read a business website? $0.10 per site](https://www.omenz.org/flyers/agent-ready-checker.json)\n- [Lead List Website Check: is a business website live, parked, hijacked or bot-walled? $0.002 per site](https://www.omenz.org/flyers/lead-list-website-check.json)\n\n## Research\n- [SCRIBE: OMENZ public research record](https://www.omenz.org/research/)\n\n## Services, education and digital products (Gumroad)\n- [Agent-Ready Check: human-reviewed audit, $149](https://kadeelac.gumroad.com/l/gxdbx)\n- [Workflow Diagnostic (pilot), $149](https://kadeelac.gumroad.com/l/noqcwz)\n- [DIG: dig decisions and state out of your ChatGPT history, $29](https://kadeelac.gumroad.com/l/txaeo)\n- [OMENZ Prompt Pack, Volume 1, $9](https://kadeelac.gumroad.com/l/fazlvp)\n- [Caught in Code, Chapter One, $10](https://kadeelac.gumroad.com/l/ybgil)\n\n## AI persona\n- [SheGPT](https://shegpt.online)\n"
 ],
